   "allow_from": "2026-10-20 16:00",
   "note": "from the Tue 16:00 handoff only (lab-load refuses makoto before it and without this entry); B4: nice 19, at most 4 of 8 threads (8 only with mirror-voice's OK: not in any plan), no disk load; the makoto session's stop lines (CPU 88, Card Side 57, DDR 75, NVMe 72); Card Side, DDR, MB and the BMC CPU come from makoto-fan's /run/makoto-fan.state (its own \"t\") or the minutely ipmitool textfile, never from ipmitool (makoto-fan owns the BMC); mirror-voice guard: a wake or request in its journal stops the load; makoto_fan guard: makoto-fan active and its state fresh (t within 120 s, no emergency) on every sample, else refused / stopped on 2 bad samples (our unit names keep its stale-controller alert quiet, so this is the only protection)",
